<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALY BEAT GEORGIA 6-0 IN EURO UNDER-21 MATCH.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALY BEAT GEORGIA 6-0 IN EURO UNDER-21 MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>AREZZO, Italy 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy beat Georgia 6-0</p>
<p>(halftime 3-0) in a European under-21 soccer championship group</p>
<p>two qualifier on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Scorers: Cammarata (5th min), Lucarelli (11th and 20th</p>
<p>penalties, 65th), Tacchinardi (59th penalty), Locatelli (70th)</p>
</text>
